  "description": "Introducing a new font called Singtton Vintage. True to its name, the word ‘Singtton Vintage’ is slang for something that is the cutest, coolest, prettiest, smartest, and most fun around.\nYou are the most Singtton Vintage! Singtton Vintage is a bold script font with a vintage retro style. This font is perfect for you letter lovers because of its many alternatives and very interesting ligatures.\nAnd of course, you can use this font for branding; it’s good for logos and logotypes. The bold style makes your product look very confident to appear in the general market.\nNo doubt about it – this is a great choice for logo fonts and types. You are the most Vintage!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Introducing a new font called Singtton Vintage. True to its name, the word ‘Singtton Vintage’ is slang for something that is the cutest, coolest, prettiest, smartest, and most fun around.</p>\n<p>You are the most Singtton Vintage! Singtton Vintage is a bold script font with a vintage retro style. This font is perfect for you letter lovers because of its many alternatives and very interesting ligatures.</p>\n<p>And of course, you can use this font for branding; it’s good for logos and logotypes. The bold style makes your product look very confident to appear in the general market.</p>\n<p>No doubt about it – this is a great choice for logo fonts and types. You are the most Vintage!</p>",
